        <mxCell id="sk9yDuvugpP4l5JV54XF-9" parent="sk9yDuvugpP4l5JV54XF-8" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#fff2cc;gradientColor=#ffd966;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Адресат задания на создание ЗК&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 10px; text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;(1С:ERP) должен отличаться, в зависимости от проекта 74П:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 10px; text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;Если 245, то ответственным должна быть Аяна (Фин. телеком)&lt;br&gt;Если 237 или 001 - то Гульнура или Акерке&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;2%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3BstartSize%3D20%3Bdashed%3D1%3BfillColor%3D%23fff2cc%3BgradientColor%3D%23ffd966%3BstrokeColor%3D%23d6b656%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%229964%22%20y%3D%2211838%22%20width%3D%22318%22%20height%3D%2272%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%22480%22%20y%3D%2220%22%20width%3D%22140%22%20height%3D%2230%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%223%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%D0%92%20%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B8%20(%D0%B2%20%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%B8)%20%D0%90%D1%8F%D0%BD%D0%B0%20%D0%B2%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%8B%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B0%20%D0%B2%20%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D1%83%D1%8E%D1%89%D0%B8%D0%B5%20%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8F%20%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE%20%E2%84%96%20%D0%97%D0%9A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B(1%D0%A1%3AERP)%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%D0%B8%20%E2%84%96%20%D1%81%D1%87%D1%91%D1%82%D0%B0%20(1%D0%A1%3AERP).%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%E2%84%96%20%D1%81%D1%87%D1%91%D1%82%D0%B0%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B(1%D0%A1%3AERP)%20%D0%B8%20%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80%20%D1%81%D1%87%D1%91%D1%82%D0%B0%20%D0%91%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%81%20%D0%9E%D0%A2%D0%9B%D0%98%D0%A7%D0%90%D0%AE%D0%A2%D0%A1%D0%AF!%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22text%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dmiddle%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Brounded%3D0%3BfillColor%3D%23fff2cc%3BgradientColor%3D%23ffd966%3BstrokeColor%3D%23d6b656%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%222%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2220%22%20width%3D%22318%22%20height%3D%2252%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3BstartSize%3D20%3Bdashed%3D1%3BfillColor%3D%23fff2cc%3BgradientColor%3D%23ffd966%3BstrokeColor%3D%23d6b656%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%229964%22%20y%3D%2211838%22%20width%3D%22318%22%20height%3D%2272%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%22480%22%20y%3D%2220%22%20width%3D%22140%22%20height%3D%2230%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCe